{
  "id": "c1-e03-work-life-balance",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Work-life balance",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what does an average working day or study day look like for you?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you make sure you have time to relax?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what sacrifices have you had to make for your career or studies?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you think attitudes to work are changing?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e03-a1",
            "c1-e03-a2",
            "c1-e03-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people dealing with the demands of work. Choose two of the pictures and say what pressures these people might be under, and how they might be coping.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these people do you think has the healthiest attitude to work?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e03-b1",
            "c1-e03-b2",
            "c1-e03-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show different working environments. Choose two of the pictures and say what the benefits of these work arrangements might be, and what drawbacks there could be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, would you like your employer to offer perks like these?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some measures employers can take to improve work-life balance, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e03-work-life-balance",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these measures benefit both employees and employers?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7400
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e03-work-life-balance",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would have the greatest impact on staff well-being?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about work-life balance.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is the idea of work-life balance realistic in highly competitive careers?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should employers be responsible for their employees' mental health?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think shorter working weeks would increase or decrease productivity?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How might work-life balance differ between generations?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is it ever acceptable to put your career before your family?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, are people who choose to work long hours always more successful?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e03-work-life-balance/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
